      "evidence": "The page says “Everything on the page is stated for n≥2.” The in-scope item def-fundamental-solution-of-a-constant-coefficient-operator states “For a constant-coefficient differential operator L=p(D) on R^n” without an n≥2 restriction, and its proof step 3.1 explicitly covers n=1. The page’s scope description is therefore false.",
